# Sidecar binaries (nidm-engine / nidm-ext-host) are staged by CI before
# `tauri build --bundles msi --config tauri.bundle.sidecars.json`.
# They are not committed. Regular `cargo build` must not require them.
#
# Install/uninstall must never write system proxy or browser policy keys.
# Native messaging host registration is HKCU-only and happens at runtime
# via the engine `host_register` op — not via WiX custom actions.
